snake, serpent. Snake is the native, & serpent the alien word; it is not a necessary consequence of this, but it is also true, that snake is the word ordinarily used, & serpent the exceptional one.
===
**snake, serpent.** *Snake* is the native, & *serpent* the alien word; it is not a necessary consequence of this, but it is also true, that *snake* is the word ordinarily used, & *serpent* the exceptional one.
