2. *So long*, & *so to —*, *do so*. *So long* used colloquially for *goodbye* or *au revoir*. It perhaps matters little for practical purposes, but the OED gives no countenance to the derivation from *salaam*, & treats the phrase as a mere special combination of *so & long*;
>>>

